Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, Urashima Taro was taken into...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Undersea Palace of the Dragon King by the turtle he saved..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wai-!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The story we're gonna show to you kids now...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to only keep it between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Else, your face might become like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So y'all, please zip your mouths like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:34.09,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.253,4.948)}Let's Solve  the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:34.09,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(655.146,407.273)}Mystery of Urashima Taro
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:34.09,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs38.891)\pos(365.518,766.673)}Brought to you by: Ko-FI.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But we haven't received any signal from the spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.90,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, is it an UFO?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.61,0:00:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The signal sent back from the rocket is traced back to the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.49,0:00:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We are further investigating, as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it is about to approach Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.87,0:01:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir! We've traced the spacecraft from where the signal was sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The missing spaceship?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.17,0:01:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a miracle. a miraculous twist indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.60,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home, at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I had missed the earth for an year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I made my family worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.69,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We have contacted your family on the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son will be coming to pick you up, any moment from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Sorry for making you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.70,0:01:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me land safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to meet my son whom I haven't seen for an year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.89,0:02:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You are...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.35,0:02:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.10,0:02:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.15,0:02:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't really blame you for being surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.19,0:02:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, 1 year in space = 60 years on Planet Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is your mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She passed away 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.01,0:02:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How emotional!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But why didn't the pilot alone grew older?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When the moving speed of an object gets closer to the velocity of light
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the time slows down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.85,0:02:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That is to say, inside the rocket, the time will simply slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.23,0:02:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giant. Do you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:02:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I was 1 hour late when I came out of the bullet train, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But to be precise, It is the principle of relativity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A great scientist, Dr. Einstein wrote so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't y'all know the story of Urashima Taro?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, in return for saving a Tortoise..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.09,0:03:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,he feasted upon a banquet at the...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...Underwater Palace of the Dragon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah and he received a Pandora's Box as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But when he opened it, he became an old man in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weird story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, the 3 days in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Palace of the Dragon King = 300 years in the land world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.27,0:03:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that must have been an account of Interstellar space travel...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tortoise must've been an Alien or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.73,0:03:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he rode on the interstellar spacecraft...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...which resembled a tortoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.90,0:03:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Because jumping into the sea without...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,...wearing an oxygen tank, wouldn't make any sense and is impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he was taken to the planet that looked like Dragon King's Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a point, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me that the tale of Urashima Taro was...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,...in fact an historical event?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it's a fairy tale, how romantic It'd be if it were to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.67,0:03:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's research and study about Urashima Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.80,0:04:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it as part of our summer vacation's group study.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We all agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help us, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Time Machine or the Anywhere Door would do the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.73,0:04:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's just a fairy tale, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Urashima Taro might have never existed in reality, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to be sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, will you help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,After I make a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,To whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I 'd like to speak to the Time Investigation Corps and confirm!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.78,0:04:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What? He really existed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ok...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They said he existed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In August 1049, he disappeared along side the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the year 1349, he came home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, let's go ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Destination: Year 1049!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have brought my camera with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.19,0:04:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to take some memorable photos!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, of course you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yayy!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Year 1049, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere along the coast...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There exists Urashima Taro...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that might be the tortoise from the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why Urashima Taro isn't here, yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.39,0:05:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be here in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.73,0:05:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't change the history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah. he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That must be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy is Urashima Taro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He is worse than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.16,0:05:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That is {\i1}but{\i0} history.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! There he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The historical moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This Urashima Taro sure is rowdy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The tortoise looks rather tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.48,0:06:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If he eats the tortoise, the rest of the story will never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.61,0:06:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You want to trade this tortoise with something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kids' from the nearby village?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.91,0:06:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How much money do you have with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}1000.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnCalibri}¥{\fnBalloon Lettering}1000?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I have with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't use this note as money in the year 1049.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.05,0:06:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dora-{\i1}chan{\i0}, please help me buy the tortoise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, I don't mind exchanging that shiny thing on your chest with this Tortoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:07:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, my Mum bought this broach for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So the deal's off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.31,0:07:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then forget about the Tortoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.65,0:07:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, tortoise, you can be rest assured now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful so that you won't get captured again by humans...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, will you become Urashima Taro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, that'd be weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But you saved it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you send it back to the sea, Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.64,0:07:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Gouda Takeshi, not Urashima Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It is different from the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.31,0:07:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let you escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.90,0:07:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our homework would be incomplete without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.69,0:07:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not trouble any living creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go back to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.61,0:07:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the real Urashima Taro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, you can rest assured now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go back to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like how I imagined you to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get caught by mischievous children ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What? We troubled the tortoise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.80,0:08:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.49,0:08:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't run off on your own...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how much, the princess was worried about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you save the tortoise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tortoise is the Princess' pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:08:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd like to reward you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.31,0:09:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Go aboard the ship please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.90,0:09:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.90,0:09:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you let them just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We've no choice but to follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that, not this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it! The Diving Airship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This Diving Airship...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.67,0:09:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So the tortoise isn't an alien but a pet of the Princess Oto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It is going to sink down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Palace of the Dragon King is located in the seabed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is surprising that there is a submarine at this ancient era.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She might be an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Princess Oto is an alien, I can't wait to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.55,0:10:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to feast upon the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so like you, Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one will ever believe that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,...we've been to Palace of the Dragon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course 'cause yer untrustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright, I've brought my camera to {\i1}take{\i0} pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.87,0:10:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The speed is being increased!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. But the speed is very high.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,5000 meters deep, 6000 meters...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Speed, speed...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't know.. Looks like we might time slip!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that break the Airship?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.73,0:11:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it can run on par with the speed of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It is tremendous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going to get into the deep sea area.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It fades to dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this strange space?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we have slipped into an another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems as if we are floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that a huge city lies at the ocean bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is the Palace of the Dragon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, this is Palace of the Dragon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going to crash land!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I will die in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.01,0:12:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon! Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.93,0:12:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita... There is air, hmm...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How come so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the entrance to the Palace of the Dragon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.81,0:12:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, we can't get inside..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to take a photo for commemoration, say cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.65,0:12:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,OK? Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,OK...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the spies came from the land world?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We come here just for our summer vacation study.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What, study...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I arrest you for spying on our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum, I am scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been in jail for 3 days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any gadget to escape from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.81,0:13:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I have no idea what's going on here..
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So I don't know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,For our research, we could have just did a study on rabbits or tortoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It is noisy outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look... Urashima Taro is going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.29,0:13:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He has the Pandora's Box with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, Urashima Taro feasted while we rot here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus he's got the box as gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we are in meeting to discuss your punishment...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As spies, they must be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.93,0:13:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is but the eternal law.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They are but only minors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But they must be punished...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What if they leak about our country, in the land world?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.90,0:14:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did we let Urashima Taro go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He was given the Pandora's Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't keep his mouth shut, he will become an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,President, what is the opinion of Princess Oto?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.37,0:14:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,i don't want our princess to know about them...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.25,0:14:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We must decide how to punish them, on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The sentence is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.32,0:14:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You all will be killed on the ground of being spies from the land world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:14:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to eat more Dorayaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.97,0:15:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.05,0:15:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. president.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.81,0:15:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please abort the spies' execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The judgement is already passed..
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For the well-being and security of our country, there is no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We found this picture after checking their camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,These pictures prove that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,those kids are the ones who actually saved the tortoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.55,0:15:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We are very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.01,0:15:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay if you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:16:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy your stay with us and Bon Appetite!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why I love fairy tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a glutton, so anything is tasty for you, Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do you grow these tasty food here, all the way down in the seabed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We use special techniques to grow our food here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm curious. Are you the undersea race or an alien race?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.26,0:16:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually we used to live on land, a very long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do you live in undersea now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Millions of years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.39,0:16:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Our civilization was more technologically advanced than now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our country was located in the land world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.61,0:16:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a beautiful and abundant country.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,However, many wars broke out on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.91,0:17:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A neighboring country tried to annex our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.58,0:17:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to save our country...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,my father decided to move the country beneath the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That was thanks to help from the scientists from all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus our country sunk to the seabed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,After that the land world was ruined by wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The history is about to repeat itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This country is in the different dimension than the land world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.65,0:17:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So the time passes slowly here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We are watching how the world's changing from beneath the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But we don't want to be involved into any conflicts...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.45,0:17:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We will create the world of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.87,0:17:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We have Doraemon with us, to ensure that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.17,0:17:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. You kids' are the future of the land world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please create a peaceful and prosperous land world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.63,0:17:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be watching your world from right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.51,0:18:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.51,0:18:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I but have an only request.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please promise me that you'll never tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.56,0:18:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,a word about our country, to anyone in your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then our homework would be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How disappointing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.11,0:18:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But... you haven't gifted us a Pandora's Box. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you children, so I won't gift you such horrible device.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.21,0:18:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer this world after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.51,0:18:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it's a fairy tale, its' reality sure is hard to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the Time Machine is broken, and we couldn't go back to our time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.06,0:18:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't scare us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.48,0:18:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It {\i1}really{\i0} is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.90,0:19:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The entrance of the Time Machine has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was here, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what about us...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your gadgets are always like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really...!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.42,0:19:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.79,0:19:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It is useless to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be humans living in 1049.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's find some house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no baseball in this era.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And no TV neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No shower neither...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Mum's must be worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.45,0:19:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Still we can't find any house at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It is dark, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Walk faster, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.18,0:20:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.91,0:20:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We are saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.00,0:20:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you kids doing here at this late?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Cop, what year is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.55,0:20:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's now 1985. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.84,0:20:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay, we are saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with these kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We stayed 4 days in the Palace of the Dragon King...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,...while in the land world, 800 years have been passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.89,0:20:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,i understand now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.27,0:20:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.19,0:20:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.78,0:21:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, kids front of the TV screen...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please make sure to keep the secret of Princess Oto to yourself only...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me that you will...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
